    A section with a heading and the products as cards in a grid, as a list of horizontal cards, or as a rail that scrolls sideways; an empty state when there are none. Axes: layout (grid, list, rail), columns, ratio, rating, action, tone, density.
    Props (p): id, title, products, labels, badges, layout, cols, ratio, rating, action, tone, density, landmarkLabel. *}
{var $v_id = ($p['id'] ?? null)}
{var $v_title = ($p['title'] ?? null)}
{var $v_products = ($p['products'] ?? null)}
{var $v_labels = ($p['labels'] ?? null)}
{var $v_badges = ($p['badges'] ?? null)}
{var $v_layout = ($p['layout'] ?? 'grid')}
{var $v_cols = ($p['cols'] ?? '1-3')}
